flowchart TD
    Start([START]) --> Triage[Triage]
    Triage -->|answerable| Retrieval[Retrieval]
    Triage -->|requires clarification| Clarification[Clarification response]
    Triage -->|requires escalation| Escalation[Escalation response]
    Triage -->|out of scope| Refusal[Safe refusal]
    Retrieval --> Generation[Generation]
    Generation --> Verification[Verification]
    Verification -->|pass or retry cap reached| Finalize[Finalize]
    Verification -->|fail and retry_count less than 1| Revision[Revision]
    Revision --> Verification
    Clarification --> End([END])
    Escalation --> End
    Refusal --> End
    Finalize --> End
